    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9708926131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-e05fc03f80f8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 380.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 163589,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two Planes, Two Credentials\nThe AWS API and IAM build the RDS instance. A\ndatabase connection and a database role build\nwhat is inside it. Each plane needs its own\ncredentials. A provider setting can use a data\nsource, so the PostgreSQL provider can read\nits host or password from AWS ([provider docs]\n(https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provide\nr-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/website/docs/index.h\ntml.markdown#L118-L124)). It cannot safely use\nan attribute of an instance that the same run\ncreates. So keep the instance and the objects\ninside it in separate root modules.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-e05fc03f80f8",
      "originalText": "Two Planes, Two Credentials\nThe AWS API and IAM build the RDS instance. A database connection and a database role build what is inside it. Each plane needs its own credentials. A provider setting can use a data source, so the PostgreSQL provider can read its host or password from AWS ([provider docs](https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provider-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/website/docs/index.html.markdown#L118-L124)). It cannot safely use an attribute of an instance that the same run creates. So keep the instance and the objects inside it in separate root modules.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "two-planes-two-credentials"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
