      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Owners Need No Grants\nThe owner of a table has all privileges on it,\nand PostgreSQL's docs say there is no need to\ngrant privileges to the owner ([GRANT](https:/\n/www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-grant.htm\nl)). An owner can, however, revoke its own\nprivileges ([privileges](https://www.postgresq\nl.org/docs/current/ddl-priv.html)). So a\n`REVOKE` that a grant resource runs against\nthe owner really removes the owner's rights.\n\nA table's access list shows these rights as\nletters. For example, `app=arwdxt/app` means\nthat role `app` holds these privileges,\ngranted by `app`:\n\n| Letter | Privilege |\n| --- | --- |\n| `r` | SELECT |\n| `a` | INSERT |\n| `w` | UPDATE |\n| `d` | DELETE |\n| `D` | TRUNCATE |\n| `x` | REFERENCES |\n| `t` | TRIGGER |\n\nThis entry has no `D`, so `app` cannot run\n`TRUNCATE` on the table, even if it owns it\n([ACL letters](https://www.postgresql.org/docs\n/current/ddl-priv.html)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-3673e00101fa",
      "originalText": "Owners Need No Grants\nThe owner of a table has all privileges on it, and PostgreSQL's docs say there is no need to grant privileges to the owner ([GRANT](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-grant.html)). An owner can, however, revoke its own privileges ([privileges](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-priv.html)). So a `REVOKE` that a grant resource runs against the owner really removes the owner's rights.\n\nA table's access list shows these rights as letters. For example, `app=arwdxt/app` means that role `app` holds these privileges, granted by `app`:\n\n| Letter | Privilege |\n| --- | --- |\n| `r` | SELECT |\n| `a` | INSERT |\n| `w` | UPDATE |\n| `d` | DELETE |\n| `D` | TRUNCATE |\n| `x` | REFERENCES |\n| `t` | TRIGGER |\n\nThis entry has no `D`, so `app` cannot run `TRUNCATE` on the table, even if it owns it ([ACL letters](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-priv.html)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "owners-need-no-grants"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3603093179,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-7bbe586948d3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1276.8,
      "y": 1160.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
