    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4282887795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-319d7052e62d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 1680.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 420.0,
      "seed": 396725,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What You Will See\n| Resource | PostgreSQL object | What to check\n| Import ID |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `postgresql_role` | role, or a user when\n`login = true` | Password source, `roles` list\n| `name` |\n| `postgresql_database` | database and its\nowner | Owner, `prevent_destroy` | `name` |\n| `postgresql_schema` | schema | Owner |\n`db.schema` |\n| `postgresql_extension` | extension, such as\n`uuid-ossp` | Which database | `db.extension`\n|\n| `postgresql_grant` | privileges of a role on\none kind of object | Grantee, object type,\n`objects`, `privileges` | No import |\n| `postgresql_default_privileges` | rules for\nfuture objects | The `owner` role | No import\n|\n| `postgresql_grant_role` | membership of a\nrole in another role | Conflicts with the\n`roles` list of `postgresql_role` | No import\n|",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-319d7052e62d",
      "originalText": "What You Will See\n| Resource | PostgreSQL object | What to check | Import ID |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `postgresql_role` | role, or a user when `login = true` | Password source, `roles` list | `name` |\n| `postgresql_database` | database and its owner | Owner, `prevent_destroy` | `name` |\n| `postgresql_schema` | schema | Owner | `db.schema` |\n| `postgresql_extension` | extension, such as `uuid-ossp` | Which database | `db.extension` |\n| `postgresql_grant` | privileges of a role on one kind of object | Grantee, object type, `objects`, `privileges` | No import |\n| `postgresql_default_privileges` | rules for future objects | The `owner` role | No import |\n| `postgresql_grant_role` | membership of a role in another role | Conflicts with the `roles` list of `postgresql_role` | No import |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "pg-what-you-will-see"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6123591301,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-2ddb7537c012",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
