    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5929958791,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-cfcb0b477ba5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1897.6,
      "y": 2460.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 262.5,
      "seed": 612672,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plan Needs the Database\nWhen the state holds PostgreSQL resources, the\nplan connects to the server. Without a network\npath or with a wrong password, it fails before\nany diff, and each attempt can wait up to the\n180-second `connect_timeout` ([provider settin\ngs](https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-prov\nider-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/postgresql/provid\ner.go#L181-L187)). The provider has no\nbuilt-in bastion option; a SOCKS5 proxy\nthrough `ALL_PROXY` works ([provider docs](htt\nps://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provider-po\nstgresql/blob/v1.27.0/website/docs/index.html.\nmarkdown#L333-L337)). A runner inside the\nprivate network avoids the problem.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-cfcb0b477ba5",
      "originalText": "Plan Needs the Database\nWhen the state holds PostgreSQL resources, the plan connects to the server. Without a network path or with a wrong password, it fails before any diff, and each attempt can wait up to the 180-second `connect_timeout` ([provider settings](https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provider-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/postgresql/provider.go#L181-L187)). The provider has no built-in bastion option; a SOCKS5 proxy through `ALL_PROXY` works ([provider docs](https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provider-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/website/docs/index.html.markdown#L333-L337)). A runner inside the private network avoids the problem.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "plan-needs-the-database"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
