    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8096191246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-e3628dd16989",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1897.6,
      "y": 2732.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 157.5,
      "seed": 354391,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Workspace and Server Can Disagree\nThe workspace chooses the state, but the `PG*`\nenvironment variables choose the server. When\nthe object names are the same in every\nenvironment, a local run with the wrong\n`PGHOST` changes the wrong server, and the\nplan looks normal. Set `host` from a data\nsource of the environment's instance, so the\nworkspace decides both.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-e3628dd16989",
      "originalText": "Workspace and Server Can Disagree\nThe workspace chooses the state, but the `PG*` environment variables choose the server. When the object names are the same in every environment, a local run with the wrong `PGHOST` changes the wrong server, and the plan looks normal. Set `host` from a data source of the environment's instance, so the workspace decides both.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "workspace-and-server-disagree"
      }
    },
