      "text": "Destroy Pitfalls\nThese pitfalls turn a refactor into a\ndrop.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-443be9e9b99b",
      "originalText": "Destroy Pitfalls\nThese pitfalls turn a refactor into a drop.",
