    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4400792716,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-eba857c57c8b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 5174.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 192.5,
      "seed": 251968,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Close the Default Doors\nPostgreSQL grants `CONNECT` and `TEMPORARY` on\nevery new database to `PUBLIC`, which means\nevery role ([privileges](https://www.postgresq\nl.org/docs/current/ddl-priv.html)). So any\nlogin role on a shared server can connect to\nevery app's database. The grant resource docs\nshow how to revoke these defaults ([grant doc]\n(https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provide\nr-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/website/docs/r/postg\nresql_grant.html.markdown#L57-L66)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-eba857c57c8b",
      "originalText": "Close the Default Doors\nPostgreSQL grants `CONNECT` and `TEMPORARY` on every new database to `PUBLIC`, which means every role ([privileges](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-priv.html)). So any login role on a shared server can connect to every app's database. The grant resource docs show how to revoke these defaults ([grant doc](https://github.com/cyrilgdn/terraform-provider-postgresql/blob/v1.27.0/website/docs/r/postgresql_grant.html.markdown#L57-L66)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "close-the-default-doors"
      }
    },
